* Node.js v24.16.0
* npm v11.13.0
* Docker Desktop
* Git
* Cursor

## Local Setup

npm install

docker compose up -d postgres

npm run db:migrate

npm run db:seed

npm run dev

## Local URL

http://localhost:3000

## Authentication

Google OAuth

## Database

PostgreSQL via Docker

